# ==============================================================================
# Ensemble Snippet: NVT via NVE + Langevin thermostat
# Apply when: gentle/implicit-solvent-style thermostatting, or when a Nose-Hoover
#             chain (fix nvt) is undesirable; CHOOSE ONE: this block OR fix nvt
# ==============================================================================
# USAGE:
# - damp is the Langevin damping constant; a typical value is 100 fs
#   (units metal: 0.1 ps; units real: 100.0 fs).
# - seed is REQUIRED (any positive integer); fix it for reproducibility.
# - Do NOT combine with fix nvt on the same group (double thermostat).

fix             dyn all nve
fix             lg all langevin 300.0 300.0 0.1 12345
#                          Tstart Tstop damp(ps, metal) seed
